        <title>Discontinuous Galerkin Method Applied to Critical Phenomena in Gravitational Collapse</title>
        <published>2026-08-04T00:00:00+00:00</published>
        <updated>2026-08-04T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>
            
              Unknown
            
          </name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://sylviamesicek.github.io/publications/galerkin/"/>
        <id>https://sylviamesicek.github.io/publications/galerkin/</id>
        
        <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;This work applies the FEM-based Discontinuous Galerkin method to simulations of critical phenomena in spherically symmetric black hole collapse.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
