&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Citation&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: Johnson, S., Mesicek, S., &amp;amp; Belz, J. (2026). Discontinuous Galerkin method applied to critical phenomena in gravitational collapse. &lt;em&gt;Physical Review D, 114&lt;&#x2F;em&gt;(4). https:&#x2F;&#x2F;doi.org&#x2F;10.1103&#x2F;k9rg-pb8z&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
